  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nfor 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra 5.5ft (Excl. Trail Edition) with Deck Rail System\nFeatures\n【Precisely Fit】100% factory brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'6\" bed of 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Toyota Tundra with Deck Rail System(Excl. Trail Edition).\n【Easy Installation】No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with adjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user-friendly design for easy assembly and disassembly.\n【Safety First】Latch lock and adjustable tension system on the end of the side rails keep the cover closed tightly; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while driving.\n【Premium Quality】Made with double-layer PVC on the top, structured with solid alloy in the frame, this back cover is built to last for your truck.\n【All season Protection】 Features tear-resistant, water-resistant, and high-temperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve got you covered.",
